OL,3,GNEWSAWho are the candidates in the
OL,4,AHolborn and St Pancras by-election?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNominations closed on Tuesday 15
OL,7,FSeptember at 16:00 BST. Camden Council
OL,8,Fhas since published its full list of
OL,9,Fnamed candidates.
